      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 22,
      "end_line": 34,
      "raw": "- 속성:\n  - `hierarchyController`\n  - `renameContractAvailable`\n  - `createFolderEnabled`\n  - `deleteFolderEnabled`\n  - `viewOptionsEnabled`\n- 호출 가능 항목:\n  - `canRenameItem(...)`\n  - `renameItem(...)`\n  - `createFolder()`\n  - `deleteSelectedFolder()`\n  - `setItemExpanded(...)`\n  - `setAllItemsExpanded(...)`\n",
